iones, mapa y fotos", "url": "https://mexico.pueblosamerica.com/i/el-tomate-2/"}, {"title": "La Tomatina. Opiniones, mapa y fotos", "url": "https://mexico.pueblosamerica.com/i/la-tomatina/"}, {"title": "La Manga de los Tomates. Mapa interactivo, fotos y datos de población", "url": "https://mexico.pueblosamerica.com/i/la-manga-de-los-tomates/"}]}, "The search found two El Tomatal localities with 2010 figures, both from a third-party site (PueblosAmérica) that says it processes INEGI census data. It returned nothing for Nayarit, Sinaloa, or Baja California.\n\n- **El Tomatal, Benito Juárez, Guerrero:** The site lists 186 residents in 2010, which is 86 women and 100 men. It reports 161 residents in 2020 (La población de El Tomatal (Guerrero) es 161 habitantes). The locality sits 4.4 kilómetros de San Jerónimo de Juárez.\n- **El Tomatal, Santa María Colotepec, Oaxaca:** The same site lists 628 residents in 2010, with 302 women and 326 men. It reports 747 in 2020 (La población de El Tomatal (Oaxaca) es 747 habitantes).\n\nThe Oaxaca figures do not match the query's states, but I included them because the place name matches. I did not confirm these numbers against INEGI's own tables, so check the INEGI Principales resultados por localidad (ITER) dataset before relying on them."], "durationSeconds": 6.174369292, "searchCount": 1}, "tool_result_meta": [{"id": "toolu_015yogi7zKRVuE6QoXTCRe4J", "permission_decision": {"decision": "accept", "source": "hook", "reason_type": "hook"}}]}
